<title>USA: Carroll ISD, Texas, $20 mln won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Carroll ISD, Texas, $20 mln won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $20 million of Carroll ISD, Texas, variable rate school building bonds, Series 1997, with a interest cost of 3.55 percent.</p>
</text>
